{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fZdedsIDV9qwKQ29Sv-zhQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:24.569507+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fZdedsIDV9qwKQ29Sv-zhQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/jU5RDbyou5PnibgmWhR2CIgys2X1E0kkWtEtzCWk9ibFBPV4lic0aAvLIMeZHnHvhKyt6xKejXGvxv4PTicjbNmKLQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>为促进我国高校优秀大学生的学术交流，激发青年学生对科学技术史及相关交叉领域的研究兴趣，北京大学科学技术与医学史系将于</span><strong><span><span>2026年7月6日至8日</span></span></strong><span>在北京大学举办优秀大学生夏令营。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hWtpsyibv9HOwBSpB3icx9sAwrZriagsqmPIDyD3uH36JwZJBKKXwtgRTW5iaDC2wicCv3icbI5VicKxb5Jaw2tJ3jUOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/jU5RDbyou5PnibgmWhR2CIgys2X1E0kkWtEtzCWk9ibFBPV4lic0aAvLIMeZHnHvhKyt6xKejXGvxv4PTicjbNmKLQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>本次活动围绕科学技术史研究相关领域开展深入交流，研究方向关注：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. 当代中国科技外交的历史研究</span></p><p><span>2. 科技与教育的战略与政策研究</span></p><p><span>3. 物理学史、化学史、计算科学史</span></p><p><span>4. 中国近现代通信技术及其社会与文化史</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>主办方将为参会人员提供活动期间的住宿（北京高校学生除外）和校内餐饮。</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/jU5RDbyou5PnibgmWhR2CIgys2X1E0kkWtEtzCWk9ibFBPV4lic0aAvLIMeZHnHvhKyt6xKejXGvxv4PTicjbNmKLQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>01/</span></span><span><strong><span>  申请条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hWtpsyibv9HOwBSpB3icx9sAwrZriagsqmPIDyD3uH36JwZJBKKXwtgRTW5iaDC2wicCv3icbI5VicKxb5Jaw2tJ3jUOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>全国高校应届本科毕业生（2027年毕业）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>学习成绩优秀，道德品质良好；</span></p></li><li><p><span>英语水平良好；</span></p></li><li><p><span>专业背景：申请者可以是全国高校各学科专业（含理工、人文、社科等学科）对科学、技术与医学史及其社会史、文化史、思想史等研究有浓厚兴趣的同学，特别欢迎具有理工科专业背景、愿意从事科学-人文交叉学科研究的同学。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hWtpsyibv9HOwBSpB3icx9sAwrZriagsqmPIDyD3uH36JwZJBKKXwtgRTW5iaDC2wicCv3icbI5VicKxb5Jaw2tJ3jUOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/jU5RDbyou5PnibgmWhR2CIgys2X1E0kkWtEtzCWk9ibFBPV4lic0aAvLIMeZHnHvhKyt6xKejXGvxv4PTicjbNmKLQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>02/</span></span><span><strong><span>  申请材料</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hWtpsyibv9HOwBSpB3icx9sAwrZriagsqmPIDyD3uH36JwZJBKKXwtgRTW5iaDC2wicCv3icbI5VicKxb5Jaw2tJ3jUOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>北京大学前沿交叉学科研究院2026年夏令营申请表1份（附件一）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>个人陈述（关于个人学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作以及未来学习和研究的计划、目标等）1份（附件二）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>专家推荐信3封，专家须为相关学科专业领域内的副教授（含）以上或具有相当专业技术职称（附件三）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>前两年半本科阶段成绩单（由教务部门盖章）1份，前两年半总评成绩排名证明（由教务部门盖章）1份（附件四）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>体现自身英语水平的证明，如国家英语四、六级考试、或TOEFL、雅思与GRE考试等成绩的复印件；</span></p></li><li><p><span>所在学校在学证明；</span></p></li><li><p><span>其他证明材料（如体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文或其他原创性工作成果的首页复印件、获奖证书复印件等）。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hWtpsyibv9HOwBSpB3icx9sAwrZriagsqmPIDyD3uH36JwZJBKKXwtgRTW5iaDC2wicCv3icbI5VicKxb5Jaw2tJ3jUOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/jU5RDbyou5PnibgmWhR2CIgys2X1E0kkWtEtzCWk9ibFBPV4lic0aAvLIMeZHnHvhKyt6xKejXGvxv4PTicjbNmKLQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>03/</span></span><span><strong><span>  提交申请</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hWtpsyibv9HOwBSpB3icx9sAwrZriagsqmPIDyD3uH36JwZJBKKXwtgRTW5iaDC2wicCv3icbI5VicKxb5Jaw2tJ3jUOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>网上报名</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人请登录网址：</span></p><p><span>http://aaissummer.pku.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>注册并填写夏令营报名申请表。网上申报时间为</span><strong><span><span>6月1日8:00-6月14日17:00</span></span></strong><span>，逾期不予受理。申请人应当如实填写个人学习情况等网上报名信息并提供真实材料。主办方收到申请人报名材料或报名截止后，申请人的报名信息一律不作修改。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>提交材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>专家推荐信上传方式为：学生本人在网报系统中填写完成所有报名信息并点击“保存”后，请点击推荐专家电子邮箱右侧的“发送邮件”按钮，推荐专家的相应邮箱会收到系统自动发送的推荐信上传链接，推荐专家本人点击链接上传专家推荐信后，学生的报名系统会显示“已上传推荐信”。三封专家推荐信全部上传完成后，可以点击“提交”按钮进行报名材料提交。</span></p><p><span>请将所有申请材料（除推荐信外）按照以上顺序合并成一个<span>不超过20页的PDF文档（不含推荐信）</span>在报名系统上传，命名为<span>“姓名+学校+申报中心名称”</span>；</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人可通过查看个人注册邮箱或登录网上报名系统http://aaissummer.pku.edu.cn查询申请状态和审核状态等信息，材料审核期间不接受电话或邮件询问进展情况。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hWtpsyibv9HOwBSpB3icx9sAwrZriagsqmPIDyD3uH36JwZJBKKXwtgRTW5iaDC2wicCv3icbI5VicKxb5Jaw2tJ3jUOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/jU5RDbyou5PnibgmWhR2CIgys2X1E0kkWtEtzCWk9ibFBPV4lic0aAvLIMeZHnHvhKyt6xKejXGvxv4PTicjbNmKLQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>04/</span></span><span><strong><span>  联系方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hWtpsyibv9HOwBSpB3icx9sAwrZriagsqmPIDyD3uH36JwZJBKKXwtgRTW5iaDC2wicCv3icbI5VicKxb5Jaw2tJ3jUOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>俞老师，电话: 010-62757241</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>Email: hstm@pku.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hWtpsyibv9HOwBSpB3icx9sAwrZriagsqmPIDyD3uH36JwZJBKKXwtgRTW5iaDC2wicCv3icbI5VicKxb5Jaw2tJ3jUOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>具体详情可登录北京大学前沿交叉学科研究院网站查询</span></span></p><p><span><span>http://www.aais.pku.edu.cn/info/1058/19671.htm</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span><span>“申请材料</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>详见</span><span>阅读原文</span></span></span><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>科学技术与医学史系</span></p><p><span>2026年5月28日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>排版：王清影</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑：张雪梅</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核：曹 琪</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>本微信公众号所有原创内容，由北京大学科学技术与医学史系官方微信自身创作或邀请作者创作，收集的文字、图片和音频资料，版权属本官方微信所有。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>如需投稿或转载，请与北京大学科学技术与医学史系官微联络。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hdZaibhe2SpyPfpNlTiadAq0JdZibSibjh4P7lNgDA82XrB11PZwrrtWDgUeL9xYmibH4W6KXGHpNmofOOibWjWOxDlwxa2tnQuBOVuvlowibbib1zI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"9043823f33b3d3df47770cd8342fb32f348eb8130afee3ad071a8f8fb45bc730","textLength":1412,"sourceSha256":"4cb34a22676af813ae316deafc93833c626c04209661f8bcd4f11a5917f088a3","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b7864fee401868c0e413","title":"2026年北京大学前沿交叉学科研究院科学技术与医学史系2026年优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:24.569507+00:00"}
